    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our days. Moscow. Brother and sister are increasingly starting a scandal about an old apartment in the center, which costs quite a lot. The sister\u2019s husband intensifies the situation and, in the end, forces our hero, Oleg Mazapov, to go in search of money to buy out her share and save the apartment. But everything was not as simple as he expected...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the role of Oleg Mazapov, you will have to follow the path of making money and get out of the problems that stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Classic Point and Click gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Saves are exist<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lots of memes and references to reality<br><br>- Pumping up score</p>",
